- 示例：
  ```env
  NEXT_PUBLIC_DB_INIT_MODE=json
  NEXT_PUBLIC_DB_INIT_SOURCE=./mock-data.json
  NEXT_PUBLIC_DB_INIT_LOAD_DEFAULT=true
  NEXT_PUBLIC_DB_INIT_TABLES=users,settings
  ```
- 典型场景：
